    "legal.privacy-body": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StelyraAgent performs astrological calculations on your device. ChatGPT does not calculate charts or provide the app’s fixed chart content; it only helps refine a report when you request one. The name or nickname, relationship type when applicable, and calculated chart results are sent through StelyraAgent Relay to ChatGPT, provided by OpenAI. Your profile birth date, birth time and birthplace are not sent. You can use a nickname if you prefer.\n\nRelay retains an anonymous User ID, a hashed installation link and App Attest records, subscription and purchase records, Credit and report-delivery records, and limited service-usage metadata. Submitted names and calculated results are used only to service the request and are not retained by Relay. The generated report is stored encrypted only until this device saves it and acknowledges delivery; Relay then deletes it and no longer stores it. ChatGPT processes the request under OpenAI’s privacy terms.\n\nIf you enable iCloud Backup, profiles, reports and settings are stored in your private iCloud container governed by your Apple account. Delete account and data in Account settings clears local and iCloud personal data and Credits, deactivates the old User ID, and creates a new empty User ID. Minimal purchase and account-lineage records are retained for financial history, subscription restoration, and duplicate-credit prevention. Submitted feedback can be deleted through Support."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StelyraAgent 在设备本地完成占星计算。ChatGPT 不计算星盘，也不生成 App 内固定星盘内容；只有你主动请求报告时，ChatGPT 才辅助优化报告。名字或昵称、适用时的关系类型及已计算星盘结果会经 StelyraAgent Relay 发送给 OpenAI 提供的 ChatGPT。不会发送 Profile 中的出生日期、出生时间和出生地点；如担心姓名泄露，可以使用昵称。\n\nRelay 会保留匿名 User ID、经过哈希的安装关联与 App Attest 记录、订阅与购买记录、Credit 与报告交付记录，以及有限的服务使用元数据。提交的名字和计算结果仅用于处理该次请求，Relay 不会持续保留。生成的报告只会加密暂存至本机保存并确认交付；确认后 Relay 会立即删除且不再保存。ChatGPT 按 OpenAI 的隐私条款处理该请求。\n\n如果启用 iCloud 备份，人物、报告和设置会保存到由 Apple 账户管理的私人 iCloud 容器。在账户设置中使用“删除账户与数据”会清除本机和 iCloud 的个人数据及所有 Credits，停用旧 User ID，并创建新的空 User ID。为保留财务历史、恢复订阅及防止重复领取 Credits，会保留最小化的购买和账户关联记录。已提交的反馈可通过 Support 请求删除。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StelyraAgent realiza los cálculos astrológicos en el dispositivo. ChatGPT no calcula cartas ni proporciona el contenido fijo de la app; solo ayuda a perfeccionar un informe cuando lo solicitas. El nombre o apodo, el tipo de relación cuando corresponda y los resultados calculados se envían a ChatGPT, proporcionado por OpenAI, mediante StelyraAgent Relay. No se envían la fecha, hora ni lugar de nacimiento del perfil. Puedes usar un apodo.\n\nRelay conserva un User ID anónimo, una vinculación de instalación con hash y registros de App Attest, suscripciones y compras, Credits, entrega de informes y metadatos limitados de uso. Los nombres y resultados enviados se usan solo para atender la solicitud y Relay no los conserva. El informe se almacena cifrado solo hasta que este dispositivo lo guarda y confirma la entrega; después Relay lo elimina y deja de conservarlo. ChatGPT procesa la solicitud conforme a las condiciones de privacidad de OpenAI.\n\nSi activas iCloud Backup, perfiles, informes y ajustes se guardan en tu contenedor privado. Eliminar cuenta y datos borra los datos personales locales y de iCloud y todos los Credits, desactiva el User ID anterior y crea uno nuevo vacío. Se conservan registros mínimos de compras y relación entre cuentas para el historial financiero, la restauración de suscripciones y evitar Credits duplicados. Los comentarios enviados pueden eliminarse mediante Support."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StelyraAgent effectue les calculs astrologiques sur l’appareil. ChatGPT ne calcule pas les thèmes et ne fournit pas le contenu fixe de l’app ; il aide uniquement à améliorer un rapport lorsque vous le demandez. Le nom ou surnom, le type de relation le cas échéant et les résultats calculés sont envoyés à ChatGPT, fourni par OpenAI, via StelyraAgent Relay. La date, l’heure et le lieu de naissance du profil ne sont pas envoyés. Vous pouvez utiliser un surnom.\n\nRelay conserve un User ID anonyme, un lien d’installation haché et les données App Attest, les abonnements et achats, les Credits, la livraison des rapports et des métadonnées limitées d’utilisation. Les noms et résultats soumis servent uniquement à traiter la demande et ne sont pas conservés par Relay. Le rapport est stocké chiffré jusqu’à son enregistrement et à l’accusé de réception de cet appareil ; Relay le supprime ensuite et ne le conserve plus. ChatGPT traite la demande conformément aux conditions de confidentialité d’OpenAI.\n\nSi iCloud Backup est activé, profils, rapports et réglages sont enregistrés dans votre conteneur privé. Supprimer le compte et les données efface les données personnelles locales et iCloud ainsi que tous les Credits, désactive l’ancien User ID et crée un nouvel ID vide. Des données minimales d’achat et de filiation sont conservées pour l’historique financier, la restauration des abonnements et la prévention des Credits en double. Les retours envoyés peuvent être supprimés via Support."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StelyraAgent astrolojik hesaplamaları cihazınızda gerçekleştirir. ChatGPT haritaları hesaplamaz veya uygulamanın sabit harita içeriğini sağlamaz; yalnızca siz istediğinizde bir raporu geliştirmeye yardımcı olur. Ad veya takma ad, uygulanabildiğinde ilişki türü ve hesaplanan harita sonuçları StelyraAgent Relay üzerinden OpenAI tarafından sağlanan ChatGPT’ye gönderilir. Profilinizin doğum tarihi, doğum saati ve doğum yeri gönderilmez. İsterseniz takma ad kullanabilirsiniz.\n\nRelay anonim bir User ID, hash’lenmiş kurulum bağlantısı ve App Attest kayıtları, abonelik ve satın alma kayıtları, Credit ve rapor teslim kayıtları ile sınırlı hizmet kullanım meta verilerini saklar. Gönderilen adlar ve hesaplanan sonuçlar yalnızca isteği yerine getirmek için kullanılır ve Relay tarafından saklanmaz. Oluşturulan rapor yalnızca bu cihaz raporu kaydedip teslimatı onaylayana kadar şifreli olarak tutulur; ardından Relay raporu siler ve artık saklamaz. ChatGPT isteği OpenAI’nin gizlilik koşulları kapsamında işler.\n\niCloud Backup’ı etkinleştirirseniz profiller, raporlar ve ayarlar Apple hesabınız tarafından yönetilen özel iCloud kapsayıcınızda saklanır. Hesap ayarlarındaki Hesabı ve verileri sil seçeneği yerel ve iCloud kişisel verilerini ve Credit’leri temizler, eski User ID’yi devre dışı bırakır ve yeni, boş bir User ID oluşturur. Finansal geçmiş, aboneliklerin geri yüklenmesi ve yinelenen Credit verilmesini önlemek için asgari satın alma ve hesap bağlantı kayıtları saklanır. Gönderilen geri bildirimler Support üzerinden silinebilir."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StelyraAgent führt astrologische Berechnungen auf deinem Gerät durch. ChatGPT berechnet keine Horoskope und stellt keine festen Horoskopinhalte der App bereit; es hilft nur dabei, einen Bericht zu verfeinern, wenn du dies anforderst. Name oder Spitzname, gegebenenfalls die Art der Beziehung sowie die berechneten Horoskopergebnisse werden über StelyraAgent Relay an ChatGPT von OpenAI gesendet. Geburtsdatum, Geburtszeit und Geburtsort deines Profils werden nicht gesendet. Du kannst auf Wunsch einen Spitznamen verwenden.\n\nRelay speichert eine anonyme User ID, eine gehashte Installationsverknüpfung und App-Attest-Datensätze, Abonnement- und Kaufdatensätze, Credit- und Berichtszustellungsdatensätze sowie begrenzte Metadaten zur Servicenutzung. Übermittelte Namen und berechnete Ergebnisse werden ausschließlich zur Bearbeitung der Anfrage verwendet und von Relay nicht aufbewahrt. Der erzeugte Bericht wird nur so lange verschlüsselt gespeichert, bis dieses Gerät ihn gesichert und die Zustellung bestätigt hat; anschließend löscht Relay ihn und speichert ihn nicht weiter. ChatGPT verarbeitet die Anfrage gemäß den Datenschutzbedingungen von OpenAI.\n\nWenn du iCloud Backup aktivierst, werden Profile, Berichte und Einstellungen in deinem privaten iCloud-Container gespeichert, der deinem Apple Account unterliegt. „Account und Daten löschen“ in den Account-Einstellungen entfernt lokale und iCloud-bezogene personenbezogene Daten sowie Credits, deaktiviert die alte User ID und erstellt eine neue leere User ID. Minimale Kauf- und Account-Verknüpfungsdaten werden für den Finanzverlauf, die Wiederherstellung von Abonnements und zur Vermeidung doppelter Credits aufbewahrt. Übermitteltes Feedback kann über Support gelöscht werden."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StelyraAgent esegue i calcoli astrologici sul tuo dispositivo. ChatGPT non calcola i temi né fornisce i contenuti fissi delle carte dell’app; aiuta soltanto a perfezionare un report quando lo richiedi. Il nome o soprannome, il tipo di relazione quando applicabile e i risultati calcolati del tema vengono inviati tramite StelyraAgent Relay a ChatGPT, fornito da OpenAI. La data, l’ora e il luogo di nascita del profilo non vengono inviati. Se preferisci, puoi usare un soprannome.\n\nRelay conserva un User ID anonimo, un collegamento dell’installazione sottoposto a hash e i record di App Attest, i record di abbonamenti e acquisti, i record relativi ai Credit e alla consegna dei report e metadati limitati sull’uso del servizio. I nomi e i risultati calcolati inviati vengono utilizzati solo per soddisfare la richiesta e non sono conservati da Relay. Il report generato viene archiviato in forma crittografata solo finché questo dispositivo non lo salva e conferma la consegna; a quel punto Relay lo elimina e non lo conserva più. ChatGPT elabora la richiesta secondo le condizioni sulla privacy di OpenAI.\n\nSe abiliti iCloud Backup, profili, report e impostazioni vengono archiviati nel tuo contenitore iCloud privato, gestito dal tuo Apple Account. “Elimina account e dati” nelle impostazioni dell’account elimina i dati personali locali e iCloud e i Credit, disattiva il vecchio User ID e crea un nuovo User ID vuoto. Vengono conservati dati minimi sugli acquisti e sulla relazione tra account per la cronologia finanziaria, il ripristino degli abbonamenti e la prevenzione di Credit duplicati. I feedback inviati possono essere eliminati tramite Support."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StelyraAgent performs astrological calculations on your device. ChatGPT does not calculate charts or provide the app’s fixed chart content; it only helps refine a report when you request one. The name or nickname, relationship type when applicable, and calculated chart results are sent through StelyraAgent Relay to ChatGPT, provided by OpenAI. Your profile birth date, birth time and birthplace are not sent. You can use a nickname if you prefer.\n\nRelay retains an anonymous User ID, a hashed installation link and App Attest records, subscription and purchase records, Credit and report-delivery records, and limited service-usage metadata. Submitted names and calculated results are used only to service the request and are not retained by Relay. The generated report is stored encrypted only until this device saves it and acknowledges delivery; Relay then deletes it and no longer stores it. ChatGPT processes the request under OpenAI’s privacy terms.\n\nIf you enable iCloud Backup, profiles, reports and settings are stored in your private iCloud container governed by your Apple account. Delete account and data in Account settings clears local and iCloud personal data and Credits, deactivates the old User ID, and creates a new empty User ID. Minimal purchase and account-lineage records are retained for financial history, subscription restoration, and duplicate-credit prevention. Submitted feedback can be deleted through Support."
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StelyraAgent는 점성술 계산을 기기에서 수행합니다. ChatGPT는 차트를 계산하거나 앱의 고정 차트 콘텐츠를 제공하지 않으며, 사용자가 요청할 때 보고서를 다듬는 데만 도움을 줍니다. 이름 또는 닉네임, 해당되는 경우 관계 유형, 계산된 차트 결과가 StelyraAgent Relay를 통해 OpenAI가 제공하는 ChatGPT로 전송됩니다. 프로필의 출생일, 출생 시간, 출생지는 전송되지 않습니다. 원한다면 닉네임을 사용할 수 있습니다.\n\nRelay는 익명 User ID, 해시 처리된 설치 연결 정보와 App Attest 기록, 구독 및 구매 기록, Credit 및 보고서 전달 기록, 제한적인 서비스 사용 메타데이터를 보관합니다. 제출된 이름과 계산 결과는 요청을 처리하는 데만 사용되며 Relay가 보관하지 않습니다. 생성된 보고서는 이 기기가 저장하고 전달 확인을 할 때까지만 암호화되어 보관되며, 이후 Relay가 삭제하고 더 이상 저장하지 않습니다. ChatGPT는 OpenAI의 개인정보 보호 조건에 따라 요청을 처리합니다.\n\niCloud Backup을 활성화하면 프로필, 보고서 및 설정이 Apple Account가 관리하는 개인 iCloud 컨테이너에 저장됩니다. 계정 설정의 ‘계정 및 데이터 삭제’는 로컬 및 iCloud의 개인 데이터와 Credit을 삭제하고 기존 User ID를 비활성화한 뒤 비어 있는 새 User ID를 생성합니다. 금융 기록, 구독 복원 및 중복 Credit 방지를 위해 최소한의 구매 및 계정 연결 기록은 보관됩니다. 제출한 피드백은 Support를 통해 삭제할 수 있습니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
